    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just that the \"hope\" people talk about feels like a lie. it's just more noise. everything is just so heavy and i'm so tired of fighting it. it feels like he's waiting for me, and the thought of finally getting to see him again... it's the only thing that actually feels peaceful. doesn't it seem like such a natural thing to want? to just want to be back with the person you love most?",
